SUMMARY:Run 3 mi: Easy run + strides
DESCRIPTION:Easy 3 mi + 4x20s strides\nPurpose of week: Re-entry: easy mile
 s and strides to confirm the foot\, back and legs tolerate running again. 
 Saturday run paused for sore legs.\nPhase: Let the foot\, back and legs re
 cover from the NYC Marathon DNF while easing speed back in. Show that you 
 tolerate strides and a light sub-threshold session before adding load.\nPa
 ce: Easy 9:40-10:30\; strides ~7:20 (20s)\nShoe: Clifton Pro\nWeek 1\, 1 R
 ecovery & re-entry\, 15 mi total\nNote: Easy runs plus strides (relaxed\, 
 20 s). Check urine color\, lateral foot\, low back (<=2/10). Saturday run 
 paused while legs recover (strength only).
END:VEVENT
